"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_32": {
"dialogue": "You two will have to fight it to make it out. Luckily, I have some friends that would be more than happy to teach you how to fight.",
"offset": Vector2(2700, 880),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
